OL,3,ATrump, Putin, and Xi issue 'joint
OL,4,Adeclaration on peace' after 90-minute
OL,5,Atalks in China
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen pressed by the BBC in the news
OL,8,Fconference, he challenges the idea that
OL,9,FRussia is the aggressor in the war
OL,11,FEarlier, Trump held separate, bilateral
OL,12,Fmeetings with Putin and Xi. He called
OL,13,Fthe Russian leader his friend - watch
OL,14,Fthe moment here
OL,16,FAfter meeting Xi, Trump said the US and
OL,17,FChina want to see an end to the Ukraine
OL,18,Fwar
